sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant API as Express
  participant User as MongoDB User
  Browser->>API: POST /api/users/register or /login
  API->>User: validate/create or find credentials
  User->>User: bcrypt hash before save (register)
  API->>API: bcrypt compare and sign JWT (login)
  API-->>Browser: response with token/cookie behavior from controller
  Note over Browser: frontend stores token in localStorage; OAuth callback also redirects with token query
  Browser->>API: protected request with Cookie or Bearer
  API->>API: jwt.verify
  API->>User: findById(decoded.id)
  User-->>API: current account
  API-->>Browser: route response
  Browser->>API: GET logout
  API-->>Browser: clear cookie response; frontend clears stored token
